--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d648cd2f634e7f84ab5173ca253cbecf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3DialogueIncorrect
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - text: 'The shadow-creature tightens its grip on the child, dragging him further
      into the darkness. The boy''s small feet barely touch the ground, his legs
      kicking weakly as he tries to resist. '
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3d8d44e99d886a4b87f58a02081682e, type: 3}
  - text: "You watch helplessly as the thing pulls the child toward its writhing,
      tendrilous mass. The boy's spirit thrashes, his face contorted in panic, but
      his efforts are futile. A keening wail, faint and desperate, escapes his lips.\r"
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Please... don't make me go back...
    characterName: "Sta\u015B"
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "The sound is raw, primal\u2014filling the space as if it could push back
      the suffocating cold. You force yourself to hold steady, not to flinch as the
      child's cries intensify. "
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: " Someone! Anyone! Please\u2014! "
    characterName: "Sta\u015B"
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: ' His body jerks as the thing drags him backward, his limbs twitching as
      if caught in a nightmare he can''t wake from.'
    characterName: "Sta\u015B"
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "The sound is wet and wrong\u2014something that should never be heard by
      living ears. You flinch before you can stop yourself, the sharp intake of breath
      leaving your mouth in a puff of mist."
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "The creature's hand\u2014if it can be called that\u2014ripples like oil,
      its fingers elongated and dark, wrenching the child apart. You turn away too
      late; the image burns behind your eyes anyway."
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You sense the cold drain out of the room as the last of the child's light
      dissolves. The silence that follows is heavier than any noise could be. Your
      hands shake at your sides, the ritual book slipping from your grip, its pages
      scattering across the stone floor.
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The boy was devoured by the creature... Forever lost and not to be remembered
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Now it's your turn...
    characterName: 
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 2229773070677313066, guid: 55bc7a16c257c4842b81e667b5ebcb97, type: 3}
    dialogueAudioClip: {fileID: 0}
  ghostName: 
  isMultipleChoice: 0
  multipleChoice:
    choiceDescription: 
    choices: []
  defaultGhostPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  startNextDialogueAutomatically: 0
  spawnEnemy: 1
  setPlayerHealthToOne: 0
  stopSoundAfterDialogue: 1
